"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_14","text":"We try not to get too involved in other people's affairs. So long as we're willing to face the consequence, we're free to do as we wish.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_15","text":"That's our rule.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_16","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_16","text":"Pretty stark contrast from the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_17","text":"Very much so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_18","text":"But then again, if the rules were the same as the Ark, how could we call this place paradise?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_19","type":"Self","speaker":"Self","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_19","text":"Did you say... paradise?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_19_06_20","text":"That's right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_19_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":